      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0d9d15ddf0dec90119d0b90be20583ccbdd2ae929b2ed499914fc0d1815d09e",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9471c4a3c47f21f2c09e2ee99ddd86a6e858facc9d2675930c93ba15f52d1fd",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "e50404cac99dea12609ca04a651d4eeab71dabd661dd303539c9c5e236131e67",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "58f80983be891a4dee79c80b5ae119d79abf23a5964b64dd7e2c938b433b3079",
      "text": "Sometimes you need the AI to act in a certain way no matter what prompt it receives.",
      "hash": "8fdf7e3a31269d06a232b2385047860ec2b4c47494fc6d32c44b04ca1aef40a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "550d691fbcb19e5d760a10d3f0fa0766df33429bdc95c3726c1032b85ae34096",
      "text": "In this example, we want the AI to summarize the text that it receives.",
      "hash": "c4b9b5d9c47a34c63de43ac48819830a1cdc9d03f1bf349efccc46f505626961"
    },
    {
      "id": "4905e05f6cef19b9d68a7672cdbd41047f75b3ab7df7b59927a084a1f414f559",
      "text": "We want to give it a role. We want to give it instructions.",
      "hash": "ae045809c342eb9b8eb80d951fdd2b787121bc82e1c4ae557bcf6aa8c18272a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d7d5d3058535224a7a18a82b0f16147b35a569d6c33fb2a38856f56114bf249",
      "text": "And we want to do all of that before it receives the prompt from the user.",
      "hash": "13f1c59a8148922c8efce2510f9cf8aecbe5799de85971f6db53fb94c8325b0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "abefd6430f2af13f69fe048dbc61403cbde6d5de955ab0c1c061a8a18ff217f8",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "51e0c7dac2b0a72d24d24150c189945dfaacf2c02f05b5dcbba52e44015994d7",
      "text": "To do that, we can use a system prompt.",
      "hash": "b7e9935c7107fbb0c4b391189552c3974f719d339ee28d3e4776b0e1d5535ccc"
    },
    {
      "id": "2011f1ed8f335e934d663373bddfdc6075a3aa762d92a2357e1657992795b36b",
      "text": "Doing that in Vercel's AI SDK is as simple as passing a",
      "hash": "79600361bef2c1451656f65c6bbf0d880a0c3d7487a83d40d995d6aa1977bdd5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b49d1e0394025196f1934b8a5f2a2744b1ccee3e13b12b34c69b718c0311919b",
      "text": "property.",
      "hash": "7175742fec0f0c94cd846ee7acdbca87716ab60ff1bb6e12b208623d7d84d1a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1ee1288cd3c777bd75c76b21649e8856d184072010682d18aaf4d65da7dcbae",
      "text": "Under the hood, this prepends a special message with a role of \"system\" that has our system prompt in it.",
      "hash": "423ee8e5fc41041fe2de396396bfdf21da8b453ce6ccb410308e521318b42dff"
    },
    {
      "id": "834c1f1a355c0e40479d7b11a3af3c6b61b8f61116bfe095a1ac77c234d0018b",
      "text": "We could do that in the AI SDK as well if we wanted to. You can pass a",
      "hash": "a8be81384792db02b2d14a5bdda7f8f43171b13ad5379b288fa67e6bd93bb9ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ba78c1e6eab73df5da75960443124ad01808a0ea0f2981f74c34594036b1f62",
      "text": "property that has an array of messages.",
      "hash": "5b14d309e7f8a65f377340044f4aa832e7b8bb5ec1acf11c227fb763476831a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2bb41722ec655b8e666c65bb917e7e16d66ce7ae1553f149b64f5388d729cdab",
      "text": "This can be done in",
      "hash": "523e408ca0218213cc161b7233e10a87dd6fcf0c65011af5ef2e474c6b5e7f57"
    },
    {
      "id": "363f43bb6501ee9f2a514c9c0d98f9a26d5b9d18d291a7d3c370d2e780b62a33",
      "text": ", and all of the other APIs that contact LLMs and GenAI.",
      "hash": "ecff27b96548c09d11b68128f6d1c048281d38ea530a17b6f5697e7a70bf8bf6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b66b20893eac1cc7f16f85d0af6394b7e260809abf52afa56420a9e9333fde98",
      "text": "Working with system prompts is one of the key parts of working with LLMs, so it's really nice that the AI SDK makes it so easy.",
      "hash": "4f49a000da184d42a822bb6d34f9c84e29f94e856100445f12e6318191ab6677"
    },
    {
      "id": "cd8e5a023e3ace80d190b4abdee73aa4a4dd4ce7e2ec58153e7b95d3f4966330",
      "text": "In our next example, we're going to see how easy it is to swap out your models whenever you need to.",
      "hash": "b2578333308c239c92ad6935d6ab7c076eced18979ed589537cdfe9c2291191d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c38471a95b5a0adec8664b5e3f84198038e1d93239626dc1b1ef4759d5a92b",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "13b995bd4073fab7c4fc1096ed6c05fe3a792c3efafd952fb987c3eed34c7239",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "c528c2963391bf84a89b38b0072f45d9feb728c4edb2f014fe280789ad97fbbf",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "86a0aa56daa230b5a4a4e2e100b11e9392f6c0fbaa8d2d6bada5f6fa546f3b46",
